  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nExpression: 1 / (5 + √3) + 1 / (5 - √3)\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nConjugate property: (a + b)(a - b) = a² - b²\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 1 / (5 + √3) + 1 / (5 - √3)\n\n⇒ [(5 - √3) + (5 + √3)] / [(5 + √3)(5 - √3)]\n\n⇒ [5 - √3 + 5 + √3] / [5² - (√3)²]\n\n⇒ [10] / [25 - 3]\n\n⇒ 10 / 22\n\n⇒ 5 / 11\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 5/11.**",
